WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,590
Thank you for being able to go shopping at the base supermarket. Don't thank me.

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,870
Thanks to our boss for not having him

3
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,310
I can't live like this either

4
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:09,350
Haven't you been following Lord Ling?

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,190
I used to be at the Tomorrow Base in City C

6
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,070
Don’t talk about holiday benefits in a place like that

7
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,390
If you don't care enough, your life will be gone

8
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,550
How could there be such a terrible place?

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,780
The reality is scarier than what I said

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,570
Alliance is left

11
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,970
It's the best base in the east

12
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,450
I've been there myself

13
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,570
You're so lucky to be a part of it

14
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,490
What do you study in school?

15
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:35,330
Fight, first aid, drive, fly a plane

16
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:36,890
Engineering Mechanics

17
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:38,210
The teacher said he expected the exam

18
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:41,370
He wants to take us to the first house line Sha Mangshi so quickly

19
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,050
We are not afraid of losing our master

20
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,530
Who will have more sand then?
